# Dependencies and Codegen

Do not add packages unless needed.

1. Prefer Flutter/Dart SDK.
2. Reuse an existing dependency (`flutter_bloc`, `go_router`, `supabase_flutter`, `cached_network_image`, `equatable`, etc.).
3. If a new package is required, choose a maintained one and explain why.
4. Never add a second package that solves the same problem (no extra state-management libs).

When the project uses code generation, follow the existing setup. Run `build_runner` after changing annotated sources and verify generated output. This app currently has little codegen; do not introduce it without a clear need.
